  Ограничения:
  - check_ordinal_position > 0
  - check_data_type_id > 0
end note

' Ограничения PostgreSQL
note bottom of postgres_objects
  Ограничения:
  - check_migration_status
  - check_object_type
  - source_object_id NOT NULL
  - source_object_id UNIQUE
end note

note bottom of postgres_tables
  Ограничения:
  - check_table_size >= 0
  - check_row_count >= 0
  - source_table_id NOT NULL
  - source_table_id UNIQUE
  - data_integrity_percentage >= 0 AND <= 100
end note

note bottom of postgres_views
  Ограничения:
  - check_check_option
  - check_complexity
  - source_view_id NOT NULL
  - source_view_id UNIQUE
end note

note bottom of postgres_columns
  Ограничения:
  - check_ordinal_position > 0
  - check_source_column_id > 0
  - check_postgres_data_type_id > 0
  - source_column_id UNIQUE
  - postgres_data_type_id NOT NULL
end note

@enduml